// Rimshot — Drums and Percussion — from Synth Templates card rimshot (schema synth-template-card/0.2)
// Generated by card-to-pdl.py: card words → vocabulary.yaml numbers → VCV Fundamental knobs. Do not edit; edit the card.
# voices: 1

@OSC1 = VCO
@MIX = VCMIXER
@AMP = VCA
@AENV = ADSR

// ── Signal flow ──
OSC1:SQR -> MIX:IN1
AMP:OUT -> OUT:IN1
AMP:OUT -> OUT:IN2

// ── Modulation ──
AENV:ENV -> AMP:CV
KEYBOARD:PITCH -> OSC1:V/OCT
KEYBOARD:GATE -> AENV:GATE

// ── Parameters ──
* OSC1: FREQ = 0 | PW = 0.1
* AMP: LEVEL = 1.0 | RESPONSE = 1.0
* AENV: A = 0.053 | D = 0.178 | S = 0.0 | R = 0.178
* MIX: LVL1 = 1.0

// ── Not carried into PDL ──
// block noise: noise source (no noise module in the registry)
// block filter1: bandpass filter (VCF has LPF and HPF outputs only)
// audio ['noise', 'mix']: edge from/to an unmapped block (noise → mix)
// audio ['mix', 'filter1']: edge from/to an unmapped block (mix → filter1)
// audio ['filter1', 'amp']: edge from/to an unmapped block (filter1 → amp)
// route vel → amp.level: input conflict (one cable per jack) (input AMP:CV already taken by aenv)
// approximated: aenv: one-shot asked; ADSR follows the gate
